          "Methodology change in FY2013: Transactions restated: 2011 questionnaire (FY2013 report). Comparisons across it should be cautious.",
          "Methodology change in FY2014: Weighting by home ownership (household-group tables). Comparisons across it should be cautious.",
          "Methodology change in FY2015: Correspondence/transactions split reclassified (FY2015 report). Comparisons across it should be cautious.",
          "Methodology change in FY2017: Correspondence/transactions split reclassified (FY2017 report). Comparisons across it should be cautious."
